      "__component": "ai-chat.faq-section",
      "id": 33,
      "fe_component": "FAQ",
      "client": true,
      "title": "<p><strong>Frequently Asked </strong><span style=\"color:#01b78d;\"><strong>Questions</strong></span></p>",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": 225,
          "title": "What exactly is AI Chat and What advantages does it offer me?",
          "content": "<ul style=\"list-style-type:circle;\"><li>AI Chat is a powerful AI chatbot that integrates multiple advanced AI models, including OpenAI GPT-4, Gemini, Claude, Grok, DeepSeek and Flux to provide fast and intelligent responses for all your needs.</li><li>The benefits of using AI Chat include:<ul style=\"list-style-type:square;\"><li>Personalization: Tailor your AI experience by choosing from various models to suit your preferences and requirements.</li><li>Speed &amp; Time-Saving: AI Chat delivers quick, accurate answers from multiple cutting-edge AI models, streamlining your tasks and saving you time.</li><li>Boundless Accessibility: Access top-tier AI support anytime, anywhere, with a range of models at your fingertips.</li><li>Continuous Updates: We are always adding the latest AI models and updates, ensuring you have access to the most advanced and up-to-date technologies.</li></ul></li></ul>"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "title": "Why subscribe? Here’s what you get",
          "content": "<ul><li>Unlock exclusive features, faster access, and personalized support designed to enhance your experience. These include<ul><li>Get precise, in-depth answers to every query.</li><li>Enjoy extended message limits for more detailed conversations.</li><li>Unlimited chats and messages—Chat as long as you need.</li><li>Experience fast response times, every time.</li><li>No interruptions—just pure, ad-free conversations.</li></ul></li></ul>"
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "title": "How do I cancel my subscription?",
          "content": "<p>To cancel your subscription, please access the ‘Account’ section in the Settings page and click on the ‘Cancel Subscription’ button. Your subscription will be canceled at the end of the current subscription period, leading to the termination of your premium membership. You will not be charged any further payments after the cancellation.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "title": "Can I upgrade or downgrade my subscription plan?",
          "content": "<p>Yes, you can easily upgrade or downgrade your plan at any time through the account settings. Changes will be applied at the start of the next billing cycle.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": 229,
          "title": "Is the platform suitable for both tech professionals and creative users?",
          "content": "<p>Absolutely! The platform is designed to cater to a wide range of users, from technical experts to creative professionals, offering tools that enhance productivity and innovation.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": 230,
          "title": "How secure is my data on the platform?",
          "content": "<p>The platform follows stringent security protocols, ensuring that user data and interactions are encrypted and protected at all times.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": 231,
          "title": "What kind of AI model customization options are available to enhance user experience?",
          "content": "<p>Users can adjust response behavior, output format, language style, and much more, allowing the platform to align with specific operational needs or creative workflows.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
        }
      ]
    }
